RING CEREMONY - INDUCTION PROCEDURE

The ring ceremony formalises your place in the sealing circle. It is brief and
without warmth.

1. Present yourself to the Leader (or his projection) at the assigned time.
2. Receive the ring corresponding to the vacant seat. Note its inscribed character
   and its assigned finger. Memorise both.
3. You will be shown the summoning that binds your ring to the Gedo Statue. During
   any full extraction you must occupy your assigned position, in person or as a
   chakra projection, for the full duration.
4. Recite no oath aloud. Your presence is the oath.

From this moment your ring is part of a nine-beast plan larger than yourself.
Failure to appear at a sealing is desertion.
